for real work situations in a simple, clear and practical way.

82
00:04:17,130 --> 00:04:18,930
If you use English at work,

83
00:04:18,930 --> 00:04:22,130
or if you plan to work in an international company,

84
00:04:22,130 --> 00:04:25,210
