88
00:04:35,690 --> 00:04:39,930
Talking to your manager can feel stressful, even in your own language.

89
00:04:39,930 --> 00:04:45,250
You might worry about making mistakes, using the wrong words, or sounding unprofessional.

90
00:04:45,250 --> 00:04:50,770
But don't worry, today's episode will help you feel more confident and more prepared.

91
00:04:50,770 --> 00:04:55,250
Today we're talking about business English at work, specifically how to communicate with

92
00:04:55,250 --> 00:04:56,250
your boss.

93
00:04:56,250 --> 00:05:02,370
You'll hear how to ask for help, talk about progress, discuss priorities, and handle problems

94
00:05:02,370 --> 00:05:03,890
calmly.

95
00:05:03,890 --> 00:05:05,330
Just relax and listen.

96
00:05:05,330 --> 00:05:08,530
You don't need to understand every word the first time.

97
00:05:08,530 --> 00:05:10,250
That's totally okay.

98
