351
00:15:37,100 --> 00:15:38,140
Hi, Kevin.

352
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:39,940
Yes, I have a few minutes.

353
00:15:39,940 --> 00:15:41,300
What's going on?

354
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:42,100
Thanks.

355
00:15:42,100 --> 00:15:44,020
