361
00:15:54,140 --> 00:15:55,340
That's smart.

362
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:57,940
Which part would you like to clarify?

363
00:15:57,940 --> 00:15:59,300
The client email.

364
00:15:59,300 --> 00:16:01,780
