365
00:16:01,780 --> 00:16:02,980
Good question.

366
00:16:02,980 --> 00:16:06,740
Keep it professional, but friendly and concise.

367
00:16:06,740 --> 00:16:07,500
OK.

368
00:16:07,500 --> 00:16:08,700
Short and polite.

369
00:16:08,700 --> 00:16:09,980
That helps a lot.

370
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:10,820
Yes.

371
00:16:10,820 --> 00:16:14,460
Clients usually prefer clear messages.

372
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:16,940
I also wanted to mention the timeline.

373
00:16:16,940 --> 00:16:17,740
All right.

374
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:19,820
Are there any concerns?

375
00:16:19,820 --> 00:16:21,220
I can meet the deadline, but I

376
00:16:21,220 --> 00:16:23,860
I want to make sure the quality stays high.

377
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:26,920
I appreciate you thinking about quality.

378
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:31,140
Would it be okay if I sent a draft first for review?

379
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:32,340
That's a great idea.

380
00:16:32,340 --> 00:16:33,860
Send it by Wednesday.

381
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:34,960
Perfect.

382
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:37,700
That makes me feel more confident.

383
00:16:37,700 --> 00:16:40,340
Confidence grows when you ask the right questions.

384
00:16:40,340 --> 00:16:44,940
I'm still learning how to express myself clearly in English.

385
00:16:44,940 --> 00:16:46,340
You're improving a lot.

386
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:49,220
Your messages are clear and professional.

387
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:50,720
Thank you.

388
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:53,720
I still feel nervous in meetings.

389
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:54,720
That's normal.

390
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:57,080
Even native speakers feel that way.

391
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,080
That's good to know.

392
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:00,480
I'll try to speak up more.

393
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,480
Start small.

394
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:03,560
Even one comment is progress.

395
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:04,880
I'll do that.

396
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:06,560
Thanks for your support.

397
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:07,560
Anytime.

398
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:08,880
Let me know if you need help.

399
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:09,880
