410
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:35,600
Especially in situations that feel difficult or stressful.

411
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:40,360
And one of the most common stressful situations is talking to your boss.

412
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:41,520
Exactly.

413
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:46,120
