00:36:44,440 --> 00:36:48,140
Yes, I know I can be a bit quiet in meetings.

780
00:36:48,140 --> 00:36:51,740
Your ideas are valuable. Don't hesitate to share them.

781
00:36:51,740 --> 00:36:55,640
I'll try to speak up more, even if it's just one comment.

782
00:36:55,640 --> 00:36:57,840
That's a perfect place to start.

783
00:36:57,840 --> 00:37:01,340
